---
import styles from './SyntaxIntro.module.css';
---

<main class={styles.syntaxIntro}>
    <h1>Stagistic syntax</h1>
    <p>
        Stagistic Syntax is an open, plain-text format for theatrical plays and musicals. It keeps acts, scenes, character cues, dialogue, stage directions,
        lyrics, and music cues in a readable .stagistic file, so your script can move between Stagistic Editor and plain-text tools. Read the
        <a href="https://docs.stagistic.com/syntax/">full Stagistic Syntax documentation <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        for format rules, examples, and a complete marker reference.
    </p>
</main>
